  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 712.27 Increased Monitoring for PFAS Contaminants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 712.27 Increased Monitoring for PFAS Contaminants. The O/O shall collect and analyze quarterly PFAS samples at all sampling points if:\n\n(a) The running annual average for any PFAS contaminant at the sampling point is above the applicable MCL; or\n\n(b) The PWS is operating any type of treatment to reduce the amount of a PFAS contaminant.\n\nSource. #12838, eff 9-30-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
}
